'''Perfect Nylocas''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires the player to kill the [[Nylocas Vasilias]] without anyone in the team attacking any Nylocas with the wrong attack style, without letting a [[Support (Theatre of Blood)|pillar]] collapse and without getting hit by any of the Nylocas Vasilias attacks whilst off prayer.

== Strategy ==
Using [[barrage spells]] or [[Black chinchompa|chinchompas]] is not recommended, so players will have to ensure they kill nylos quick enough that pillar health will not be a concern. Highlighting each nylo before you attack can help avoid accidental misclicks or a nylocas changing styles.

